          <div class="subscription-benefit"><span class="benefit-checkmark"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2340/1623/files/Path_4_4x_da362365-2654-4080-a5ca-826c6f94b7ea.svg?v=1742699622" alt="Checkmark icon"></span><span class="benefit-text">Earn Free Gifts When You Subscribe</span></div>
          <div class="subscribe-timeline-container">
